                                "sense_id": "d12ff69f-c10b-3867-b99a-3ca621129f25",
                                "text": "Don't you want to save your country, pro patria and ora pro nobis as the old I-talians used to say, and knock the eyes out of all the hugsome hussies with your uniform?"
                            },
